# m69f.ideal: m69u mirrored (y -> 2-y) for m69f, with the QC couplings re-done for the flip
# (U1 (-2,1) now sits ABOVE U0 (-2,0), s1 (4,1) above s0 (4,0)): U1's home pull on open is long (U0's coupled
# push of BL is pulled back), s1's close spit also spits s0, and on close MB pushes the LINE U1+C (U1 never
# fires at home before ML's spit, whose coupled U0 spit sends BL home).
